<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About | Cameron McVeigh</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      :root {
        --paper: #F1F0EB;
        --paper-raised: #FCFBF8;
        --panel: #E9E6DC;
        --ink: #1C2128;
        --graphite: #5B6169;
        --line: #D6D1C4;
        --line-strong: #B6AF9E;
        --steel: #3E5A6B;
        --redline: #A83B2E;
        --font-display: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
        --font-body: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
        --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        position: relative;
      }

      /* Faint drafting-paper grid, matching the homepage */
      body::before {
        content: '';
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
        background-image:
          repeating-linear-gradient(to right, rgba(28,33,40,0.035) 0px, rgba(28,33,40,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 88px),
          repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(28,33,40,0.035) 0px, rgba(28,33,40,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 88px);
      }

      main {
        max-width: 980px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 28px 24px 72px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      a { color: inherit; }

      :focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--steel);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }

      /* ── Navigation ── */
      .site-nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        padding-bottom: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .nav-wordmark {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .nav-spacer { flex: 1; }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
        gap: 28px;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--graphite);
        text-decoration: none;
        padding-bottom: 2px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover,
      .nav-links a:focus-visible { color: var(--ink); border-bottom-color: var(--line-strong); }

      .nav-links a[aria-current="page"] {
        color: var(--ink);
        border-bottom-color: var(--redline);
      }

      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .nav-links { display: flex; }
      }

      .dropdown { position: relative; }

      .dropdown-toggle {
        background: none;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
        padding: 9px 11px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        transition: background-color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
      }

      .dropdown-toggle:hover { background-color: var(--panel); }

      .hamburger {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
        width: 16px;
      }

      .hamburger span {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 1.5px;
        background-color: var(--graphite);
        transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
      }

      .dropdown.active .hamburger span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(5.5px) rotate(45deg); }
      .dropdown.active .hamburger span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
      .dropdown.active .hamburger span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-5.5px) rotate(-45deg); }

      .dropdown-menu {
        position: absolute;
        top: calc(100% + 8px);
        left: 0;
        background: var(--paper-raised);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(28,33,40,0.10);
        min-width: 160px;
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s, visibility 0.2s;
        z-index: 20;
      }

      .dropdown.active .dropdown-menu {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .dropdown-menu a {
        display: block;
        padding: 11px 16px;
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .dropdown-menu a:hover { background-color: var(--panel); }

      .dropdown-menu a[aria-current="page"] {
        color: var(--redline);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      /* ── Page header ── */
      .page-header {
        margin-bottom: 48px;
      }

      .page-header h1 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(2em, 5vw, 2.7em);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .page-dimension { margin: 14px 0 20px; }

      .page-header p {
        font-size: 1.05em;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--graphite);
        max-width: 56ch;
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* ── About content ── */
      .about-content {
        background: var(--paper-raised);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .about-section {
        padding: 32px 36px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .about-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

      .about-section h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.3em;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0 0 18px 0;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .about-section p {
        font-size: 1em;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--graphite);
        margin: 0 0 14px 0;
        max-width: 68ch;
      }

      .about-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

      /* Education rendered as a spec panel, echoing the homepage title block */
      .edu-panel {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .edu-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: 13px 18px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        font-size: 0.92em;
      }

      .edu-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

      .edu-label {
        color: var(--graphite);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.9em;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .edu-value {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 500;
        text-align: right;
      }

      /* ── Skills grid ── */
      .skills-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      @media (min-width: 720px) {
        .skills-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }

      .skill-card {
        background: var(--paper-raised);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 26px 28px;
      }

      .skill-card h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.1em;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0 0 16px 0;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .skill-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .skill-list li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 9px 0;
        color: var(--graphite);
        font-size: 0.95em;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .skill-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

      .skill-list li::before {
        content: "—";
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        color: var(--steel);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      /* ── CV download ── */
      .cv-download {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 36px 28px;
        background: var(--paper-raised);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
      }

      .cv-download h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.3em;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .cv-download p {
        color: var(--graphite);
        margin: 0 0 22px 0;
      }

      .download-btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 12px 32px;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--paper-raised);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.92em;
        transition: background-color 0.2s;
      }

      .download-btn:hover { background: var(--steel); }

      /* ── Footer ── */
      footer {
        margin-top: 68px;
        padding-top: 22px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      footer .footer-left {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12.5px;
        color: var(--graphite);
      }

      footer .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }

      footer .footer-links a {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--graphite);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      footer .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        * { transition: none !important; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <nav class="site-nav">
        <div class="dropdown" id="pagesDropdown">
          <button class="dropdown-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" aria-label="Navigation menu">
            <span class="hamburger">
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="dropdown-menu" role="menu">
            <a href="/" role="menuitem">Home</a>
            <a href="/projects/" role="menuitem">Projects</a>
            <a href="/about/" role="menuitem" aria-current="page">About</a>
            <a href="/contact/" role="menuitem">Contact</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/" class="nav-wordmark">Cameron McVeigh</a>
        <div class="nav-spacer"></div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>
          <a href="/about/" aria-current="page">About</a>
          <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <section class="page-header">
        <h1>About</h1>
        <div class="page-dimension" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="130" height="16" viewBox="0 0 130 16" fill="none">
            <line x1="1" y1="8" x2="129" y2="8" stroke="#B6AF9E" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="1" y1="3" x2="1" y2="13" stroke="#B6AF9E" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="129" y1="3" x2="129" y2="13" stroke="#B6AF9E" stroke-width="1"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p>Background, education, and the skills behind the projects.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="about-content">
        <div class="about-section">
          <h2>Who I am</h2>
          <p>
            I'm Cameron McVeigh, an MEng Mechanical Engineering student with a passion for robotics and innovative engineering solutions. Throughout my studies, I've developed a strong foundation in mechanical design, analysis, and hands-on problem-solving.
          </p>
          <p>
            More recently my placement at Labman Automation has given me a deeper understanding of electronic systems and the interdisciplinary field of electromechanical devices, where I aspire to build my career.
          </p>
          <p>
            My engineering journey has allowed me to work on diverse projects ranging from CAD design and finite element analysis to robotics control systems and manufacturing processes. I'm particularly interested in the intersection of mechanical engineering and automation, where precision design meets intelligent systems.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <h2>Education</h2>
          <div class="edu-panel">
            <div class="edu-row">
              <span class="edu-label">Programme</span>
              <span class="edu-value">MEng Mechanical Engineering, with placement year</span>
            </div>
            <div class="edu-row">
              <span class="edu-label">Institution</span>
              <span class="edu-value">[University of Nottingham]</span>
            </div>
            <div class="edu-row">
              <span class="edu-label">Expected graduation</span>
              <span class="edu-value">[2027]</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            Relevant coursework includes robotics, control systems, thermodynamics, manufacturing processes, and advanced CAD/CAM techniques.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <h2>What drives me</h2>
          <p>
            I'm driven by the challenge of turning complex engineering problems into elegant, practical solutions. Whether it's optimising a thermal system, designing a robotic mechanism, or developing manufacturing fixtures, I approach each project with curiosity and determination.
          </p>
          <p>
            Outside of engineering, I'm always looking to expand my knowledge through hands-on projects, industry collaboration opportunities, and staying current with emerging technologies in robotics and automation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-card">
          <h3>Technical skills</h3>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li>CAD design (SolidWorks)</li>
            <li>Finite element analysis (FEA)</li>
            <li>CFD</li>
            <li>Robotics &amp; control systems</li>
